  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.title": "枪尖",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.summary.p1": " ",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.summary.bold": "积累",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.summary.p2": " ",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.summary.p3": " 层数。这些层数在每次施放直接伤害技能时消耗一层。通过仔细安排你的杀戮命令时间来避免浪费层数，并始终在至少有一层激活时施放可叠加层数的技能。生存的目标是在产生之前消耗，这意味着即使你在1层时有足够的集中值和枪尖空间，你仍然应该先消耗再产生。",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.wasted.p1": "你浪费了 ",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.wasted.p2": " 个",
