  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.wasted.p4": " 层。",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.note.p1": "枪尖不会强化诸如 ",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.note.p2": " 或 ",
  "guide.hunter.survival.sections.tipOfTheSpear.note.p3": " 之类技能的周期性伤害。",
